                <div class="full-height py-5">
        <div class="container">
            
            <h3 class="me-auto underline-heading mb-4 text-black">Issuers</h3>
            
            <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-row mb-4">
                <img src="https://informinvestor.cmda.gov.mv/storage/uploads/Bxop25Yv/c/nzwm2lda-preview.jpg" alt="" width="89px" class="mb-3 w-25">
                <h3 class="fw-bolder">Centurion</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-5">
            <div class="page-blocks">
                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Centurion PLC Group was established in 2009 as a logistics company providing transportation and logistics services across the Maldives. Over time, the Group has expanded and diversified its operations to include freight forwarding, warehousing, supply chain management, ticketing, hospitality, retail, and air cargo services.
    </div>
</div>
                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Headquartered in Malé, Maldives, Centurion PLC Group operates nationwide, delivering reliable, efficient, and cost-effective solutions to its customers.
    </div>
</div>
                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    The Group was founded on the vision of its Founder, Capt. Ahmed Maumoon, to build a multi-disciplinary service company recognized for agility, innovation, and excellence.
    </div>
</div>
                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Centurion PLC Group remains committed to sustainable business practices by balancing economic performance with environmental and social responsibility. This commitment is guided by its core pillars: Customer Service, Quality of Service, Expertise, Innovation, and Integrity.
    </div>
</div>
                            </div>

            </p>


            
